Floating Budík card (export/mockups 08_volume) instead of the AOSP volume
dialog layouts: ringer mode segment (ring / vibrate / silent, active key in
mint), three vertical sliders (media or the active call/remote stream,
ringer, alarm) with labels and percent in JetBrains Mono, and a "Zvuk" key
opening the sound settings. State, visibility, timeout and outside-touch
dismissal stay the AOSP volume dialog logic; no blur.
